{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "df76553a-1eb3-8cf2-8d22-be8103a29ecd",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:26:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:24:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:24:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, Denise. Leo DeLuca. I'm, hold on, [pause] sorry, I'm standing out on the street here, so there's trucks going by. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, a little loud but go ahead. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the drain. The storm drain at 168 Callender Avenue, up the North End. Since that nor'easter that ended Saturday, two days ago, the whole thing's backed up. There's water spread right across the crosswalk by the school bus stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Across the crosswalk itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Edge to edge. And the kids are, wait, [crosstalk] hang on, there goes a truck. The kids are stepping off the curb into the road to get around it, because nobody wants wet sneakers. Cars aren't slowing down either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's a safety issue, I'm noting that. Is the water going anywhere else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:25:13-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's running down toward the neighbor's garage. Right now it's about, um, I'd say ten feet off the door. I manage the building next to it, so I keep an eye. And this is not the first time this drain's gone, I'll tell you that. Every storm, same thing, and nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I don't see a crew out there yet from this storm, so let me open a work order right now. It'll go in as a clogged drain with water in the crosswalk and heading toward a garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So what date are they coming? That's what I want to know. Is there a date on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Once it's entered it'll have a work order number and it goes into the queue. Crews are working through a lot of storm calls, so I'd say the next day or two. Because of the kids, I'll mark it urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next day or two. Okay. [pause] Sorry, I dropped my keys. Yeah, mark it urgent, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:26:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Is 401-555-0187 the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one, the landline. If I'm not there it rings out, so just try again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll have the order number read back to you when you call, or someone will ring you once it's scheduled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks, Denise. I'll be watching that corner."
    }
  ],
